n class=\"gk\">Αἰσχύνην οὐ νομίσασα θεόν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.450</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Diosc.</span> </span>). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> like αἰδώς, <b class=\"lex-tr\">sense of shame, honour</b>, <span class=\"gk\">πᾶσαν αἰ. ἀφείς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">120</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ γὰρ αἰ. &lt;πάρος&gt; τοῦ ζῆν.. νομίζεται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Heracl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">200</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δι' αἰσχύνης ἔχειν τι</span> to be <b class=\"lex-tr\">ashamed of</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IT</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">683</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">αἰσχύνην ἔχειν τινός</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">for</b> a thing, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">El.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">616</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">αἰ. ἐπί τινι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">178d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὑπέρ τινος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.10</span> </span>; joined with <span class=\"gk\">δέος</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1079</span> </span>; with <span class=\"gk\">ἔλεος</span> and <span class=\"gk\">αἰδώς,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span clas